{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "5461defe4e60c12f681e05160311d0bb9be3885e28076896896904511a5e2e4e", "ja": "ユニットの意味", "zh": "组合的意义", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "13249fb0d51842a1760b81b07664f2795909e70b36d67bb2fa46afaeb71443fb", "ja": "公演の準備が進む中、ひとりで遅くまでレッ\nスンをしているジュリア。ユニット内での立\nち位置に悩んでいると聞いたプロデューサー\nは、ジュリアはふたりを繋ぐ、なくてはなら\nない役だと告げるのだった。", "zh": "随着公演准备工作的推进，茱莉亚独自一人练习到深夜。听说她为自己在组合中的定位而烦恼后，制作人告诉她，茱莉亚是连接两人的不可或缺的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f6a03868cdca2153913c0403d6ca2035238e65b74e22d3982f333512d5e7947a", "ja": "（天体公演の準備で、すっかり遅くなってしまった。\nあとはプレス対応と告知の準備……ん？）", "zh": "（为了天体公演的准备，不知不觉忙到了这么晚。接下来还要准备媒体应对和宣传……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "abf5888385bda74bb713db43db488cc03196a5b2677d2e170d17380bc820f992", "ja": "あれ、{$P$}。\nなんだよ、まだいたのか。", "zh": "哎，{$P$}。\n搞什么啊，你居然还在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "38de121ebc2608db44465873317be70cb2b7757c0543489b334aa0c2cb2cba12", "ja": "それはこっちの台詞だ。もう遅いのに……\nずっとひとりでレッスンしてたのか？", "zh": "这话该我说吧。都这么晚了……\n你一直一个人在练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "47a6e321c2b32ad4dce00973d658fae03f17f657e65e65dbcecc484a10030f04", "ja": "ま、ちょっとな……。\n新しいアプローチを試してたんだ。", "zh": "嗯，稍微练了一会儿……  \n我在尝试新的方法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "3727b7b38060cc9676f46c7e2c7360558cf92f981950802d053b473c5150bbd6", "ja": "何かを目指すんじゃなくて、あたしの中にあるモノ……\n何でもいいから、もっと絞り出して……なんてね。", "zh": "不是去追求什么目标，而是把我心里的东西……\n不管是什么，都再多挤出一些来……开玩笑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ed4ae0d9c8a5c5aeac19cf7abc494177ab3dbb2628a019138bef01a9227167b7", "ja": "へえ……うん、いいと思うな。\nその方が、ジュリアならではの深みが出そうだ！", "zh": "哦……嗯，我觉得挺好的。这样一来，应该就能展现出只有茱莉亚才有的深度了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "e762f94a30a006676764d60aaa7458243cd64c5747b30771f022a0f591576b4b", "ja": "ふふん、だよな？　あたしもそう思ったんだ！\nうん、これなら……追いつける。", "zh": "哼哼，我就说吧？我也是这么想的！\n嗯，这样的话……就能追上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "94e56df24b49ac9807e1526d391b0111a1b46585d5d3e515a599d70478e2a01e", "ja": "……追いつける？　麗花にか？", "zh": "……追得上？是指追上丽花吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "763ddaa2c5d6615e7afdf5a6eb897ac5717f050bcc75ff29a675025741b5f345", "ja": "サヨにも、だよ。この間、夜景を見に行った時にさ、\nサヨ、何か壁を突破したなって感じがして。", "zh": "纱代也是啊。前几天去看夜景时，我感觉纱代好像突破了某种障碍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "0c4ed5016aa3d708fbb656f04af31921b6448488368cc2aa9b0948b84f0f13b4", "ja": "あたしも、負けないように頑張らないと、って。\n発破をかけられたっつーか……。", "zh": "我也得加把劲，不能输给她才行。该说是被她激了一把吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3d660ac0bb37f9222662598208e3ae0f920e642fc2caa43467dbd1a10743ab70", "ja": "切磋琢磨してくれてるんだな。\nプロデューサーとして、そうしてもらえると嬉しいよ！", "zh": "你们是在相互切磋、共同进步啊。作为制作人，能看到你们这样，我很高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "bd19161a245b5bf7b74279fae432dbbe527da7deb9d1e0ba7a0c71daa00ca4ed", "ja": "……うん。", "zh": "……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ab4196dbfb7411ffdd9bcb2207e26938f7025574cf80eb9c9756a09b2d4d6aa7", "ja": "……？\nジュリア、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "……？\n茱莉亚，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "d80246dc9d908b800117ce51a4b5297908b325c70dd26f6d9030a2c186c81dcf", "ja": "……なあ、{$P$}。\nレイとサヨってさ……。ふたりとも、すごいよな。", "zh": "……我说，{$P$}。\n丽花和纱代子啊……两个人都很厉害呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "3fc74996092376de1a5182a9ca3d19de75df66428b0e65adddfb39bbc18975fe", "ja": "レイは天才だ。サヨは努力の天才だ。\nレイが先に行っても、サヨはしっかり追いついていく。", "zh": "丽花是天才。纱代子是努力型的天才。\n就算丽花先走一步，纱代子也会稳稳地追上去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "80fb93db4e32115b57c64d7f2f820e7c572ecbc72dc9af888e105a8acba2f6a1", "ja": "あたしは、なんつーか……いつも通りなんだ。\nあたしなりに歌を仕上げて……そこは自信がある。", "zh": "我嘛，该怎么说呢……还是和往常一样。按自己的方式把歌完成……这一点我还是有自信的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "3532fa12ce6455bb6630bbc86d6dd6f0c56bb6db3610af255402b410d6cba17c", "ja": "でもさ。……これだけでいいのかな？　あのふたりと\n並んで歌うのに、何か……足りなくないか？", "zh": "可是啊……这样真的就够了吗？要和那两个人并肩歌唱，总觉得……是不是还缺了点什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5a4a2f1dad1928095580a106151c397984d73fdd5bc75c882f65926db47db9ee", "ja": "なるほど……。つまりジュリアは、ユニットメンバーの\n役に立ててない気がしてる、ってところか。", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，茱莉亚觉得自己好像没能帮上组合成员的忙，是这个意思吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "88e83a5cdb0165d990eb47e8da8ec1fa1f4fe443e24ebabfbabf1612c9a1022c", "ja": "ん……。\nまあ、そんな感じ……かも。", "zh": "嗯……。\n大概就是这样……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d30d9d1808b6517ea4eb8e506d5380c84090315031e5a647b87561c056f9b3f7", "ja": "そうだな……。\n確かに、麗花と紗代子には それぞれの個性がある。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。\n确实，丽花和纱代子各自都有自己的个性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "6a185e9a89151fde38df21d52367d571924925014078fa9358c77663fea9f595", "ja": "うん……そう思う。", "zh": "嗯……我也这么觉得。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3f37d61d71906a8f865a25d9872dbe53d9f4561b29184c4a5d64de7594aa71c8", "ja": "個性はぶつかりあって、輝くときもあるけど……。\nぶつかるだけだと、ユニットを壊すこともある。", "zh": "个性有时会在碰撞中绽放光芒……  \n但如果只是互相冲突，也可能会毁掉整个组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "ef55687d56f5ed82e558252ee9b1ae9ba69aaeea0d6e5c72bb4878f8bc8705ef", "ja": "それは……そうだな。\nあたしにも、なんとなくわかる。", "zh": "那……确实是这样。\n我也隐约能明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "f79034b35d55dc1d69af13defcb48b03710df9c8954b69b69d160a9c64113459", "ja": "うん。だからユニットには、客観的に全体を見られる、\nユニットを繋げる子が必要だと思うんだ。", "zh": "嗯。所以我觉得组合里需要一个能客观纵观全局、\n把组合串联起来的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "2f64f26f8e83e7043613d2549ab0d90880322012af18fb1268e9178dc0f34397", "ja": "うん……。え？\nまさか、それがあたしなのか！？", "zh": "嗯……。诶？\n该不会，那个人就是我吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "81b4fc27bd1f91f4799a7351ac4452c5ad9bb41a8e57b629f95921eb9f8bb744", "ja": "ああ、人選は間違いなかったみたいだな。\n今もこうして、客観的にユニットを見てくれてるし。", "zh": "啊，看来人选没错。\n你现在也依然像这样，客观地观察着组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "a0dff9c3e64e5e30b8e1d52b190e2694b422a2485b9cfd1ebb374e07a48d9ac6", "ja": "いやいやいや、ガラじゃないって！　繋ぐためとか、\n客観的？とか、そんなつもりなかったぞ！？", "zh": "不不不，这根本不合我的性格啊！什么为了连结大家、\n什么客观？我可完全没那么打算过啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "850ad2128a3c5c412802fe2966998499c947d5099bb4f40ed414cc33e74a5b64", "ja": "ほら、本人にそのつもりがなくても、いつの間にか、\n何かの役回りになってるタイプっているだろ？", "zh": "你看，就算本人没有那个打算，也会在不知不觉间，成了某种角色的人，不是也有吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "5ab1a33b964dd5f9ff733fbf7165069cbed3b1e0283ddf6b72de3d3d4f640f1c", "ja": "それが今のお前だ、ジュリア！", "zh": "那就是现在的你，茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "cca5c6eb4da9fa45047c63e7e1a7b37fd5cac795909ccec85dab190534fe2148", "ja": "なっ！？　ま、マジか……。\nあたしが、いつの間にそんな……！？", "zh": "什！？　真、真的啊……\n我什么时候，竟然变成那样了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "c15a49b85c28058173b531100b4ba8c45f6ba36dec3823be0a8a831b92b8a1ff", "ja": "もちろん、それだけじゃない。麗花と紗代子の\nパフォーマンスとの相性とか……理由はいろいろだよ。", "zh": "当然不只是这样。丽花和纱代子的表演是否合拍之类的……理由有很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "ce9fcb296e031817cccaffe014a68a9a57153962077933b918ff3c43f20e7f26", "ja": "レイとサヨの、パフォーマンス……。", "zh": "丽花和纱代的表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "285f580b94fb7ec74751486b1b5b11b87a4535d48eaf0d6b2797b399721faa49", "ja": "うん、その理由でいい。つーか、それだけでいい。\nうん、それだけってことで！", "zh": "嗯，这个理由就够了。或者说，只要这个就够了。\n嗯，就当作只是这个理由吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "3e62d4c1564bcf3e9dcb7c8f96334bdecb7ab4bb7c70aadef84e43ddeef19363", "ja": "要するに、あたしはあたしなりに、ってことだよな！\nそれでいいんだろ？", "zh": "总之，就是我有我自己的方式，对吧！这样就行了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "8396e2c13bdf50e20fbcd307bc3ac465a0fb0950f764983129127299b61180bc", "ja": "ああ、それでいいよ。ジュリアはジュリアだ。\nジュリアらしいパフォーマンス、期待してるからな！", "zh": "啊，这样就好。茱莉亚就是茱莉亚。\n我可是很期待茱莉亚风格的表演啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "95742debc79cd22e10985420366360fb193dfab330d837db882b478e371132a7", "ja": "任しとけって！　待ってな、レイもサヨも\nひっくり返るような歌、きかせてやるからな！", "zh": "交给我吧！等着啊，丽花、纱代子，我会让你们听到一首足以让你们大吃一惊的歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "ba299b2f83aabc2a9738388e77a3285846001dca340ad47040ece81e836efa4e", "ja": "はーい！　楽しみにしてるね、ジュリアちゃん♪", "zh": "好期待哦，茱莉亚♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1037_050jul", "source_sha256": "e2a5066c5fa6946f0b8b40af38aee46383fb4eac0ce1e887d41c9b265a29f6f3", "ja": "うわあああっ！　れ、レイ！？　サヨも！？\nま、まさか……聞いてたのか！？　どっから！？", "zh": "哇啊啊啊！丽、丽花！？纱代子也在！？\n难、难道说……你们都听到了吗！？从哪儿开始听的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1038_027say", "source_sha256": "302b0cae390e4c2d3b8821ea3c8b52a4ffd999aefbd9c856bdea7ad29aacf61e", "ja": "ジュリア……ジュリアの熱い気持ち、受け取ったよ！\n私と麗花さんのこと、しっかり繋いでね！", "zh": "茱莉亚……茱莉亚的热烈心意，我收到了！\n要好好把我和丽花小姐联系在一起哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "4679c6dc94341d59c8558ab7ddd91261fb273ef9ac7e34331e485f3c82811337", "ja": "全部かよ！？　くぅ、恥ずかしすぎる……！\nいるならいるって言ってくれよ、もう！", "zh": "全都听到了吗！？呜，好害羞啊……！\n你要是在的话就早点说啊，真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1040_048rei", "source_sha256": "927bdcd0177be0c5814402c988548ebc3d8c9b3b3fdffc9b5fbb33ac4dbcdd7a", "ja": "でも、お話の邪魔しちゃ悪いかなーって思って。\n仕方なく、盗み聞きしてたんだよ♪", "zh": "不过，我想着要是打扰你们聊天就不好了嘛——\n所以没办法，只好偷听了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1041_050jul", "source_sha256": "e5e835dcc22f4e1a644bc8bf59264e241adcd35d9a943845731adb8559f32435", "ja": "するなよ！\nそういうときは立ち去れ！　立ち去ってくれ！", "zh": "别这样啊！\n这种时候就该离开！快离开！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1042_027say", "source_sha256": "ba70675efc5c6a855089db838a66a16996ab8a510a8585ef1940efdb7ad1dcc4", "ja": "そんなことより{$P$}！\nこのまま私達も、レッスンに入っていいですか？", "zh": "比起那种事，{$P$}！\n我们也可以就这样开始上课吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1043_027say", "source_sha256": "6c8ec15a022d4c6282226fd48be8f569b4b1601b4ac5653c274c26b52e57dcd6", "ja": "今ここで、今すぐ、3人で歌いたいんです。\nジュリアと麗花さんと一緒に、3人で！", "zh": "我想现在就在这里，马上和3个人一起唱歌。\n和茱莉亚、丽花小姐一起，3个人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1044_050jul", "source_sha256": "98d53d0728c570a5b2702614fe2757c06894596c29b6aea2fba4025c42ea423a", "ja": "そんなこと、じゃないだろ、サヨ……。", "zh": "不是那回事吧，纱代……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "9777df52d8fcfda17f8370f26a7b40dba3afd5d1f89076ef2b0eb7722652afae", "ja": "まあ、あと1時間くらいならな。鉄は熱いうちに\n打てっていうし。無理のない範囲で頑張れよ！", "zh": "嗯，再坚持大约1小时的话，倒也没问题。都说要趁热打铁，量力而行，好好加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1046_027say", "source_sha256": "d3b700c050710525439a356cfaf6b3c84af7b750f6587892c7902b7553882b99", "ja": "はいっ！（はーい♪）", "zh": "好的！（好——♪）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1047_048rei", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1048_050jul", "source_sha256": "f7f4dbe8ecde724f29a7d7fedb352fa402b6e9640cc390ef8ea155167203b683", "ja": "はあ……。もういいや。わかったよ、歌うよ。\nとことん歌ってやる！　ふたりとも、覚悟しろよな！？", "zh": "哈……够了。我明白了，会唱的。\n那就唱个痛快！你们两个，做好心理准备吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1049_048rei", "source_sha256": "46637c8014c446ed782aecb2935c33bec459e97db25f157e22212e111358b0b6", "ja": "うん♪　それじゃあ、まずは本番っぽく！\nMCの練習からね♪", "zh": "嗯♪　那首先就模拟正式演出的感觉！\n从MC串场练习开始吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1050_050jul", "source_sha256": "e874510d31cd6c96edb2546ea53027c63d8dea46d69a463007e6dfd94a1c35bf", "ja": "歌わないのかよ！　鉄は熱いうちに打てよ！", "zh": "不唱了吗！要趁铁热的时候打铁啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1051_027say", "source_sha256": "b400e3b4e9d9c1d981eefa492770005c593d51ab2bcfb11b80bb92c55daaf32a", "ja": "じゃあ、私は麗花さんにくすぐられて、笑いが\n止まらなくなった話をしますね！　あの夜、私……。", "zh": "那么，我来说说被丽花小姐挠痒痒，笑得停不下来的事吧！那天晚上，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1052_050jul", "source_sha256": "60ad18b963899a19d418e3f08ca7667e8c9d2c700a3c1e17eba530ee6f153a5f", "ja": "サヨ……。\n歌いたいって、言ってなかったか？", "zh": "纱代……\n你不是说过想唱歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_05_1053_p", "source_sha256": "0465c910f6ec4e1582a13edc003a7f72b05a57529811e576a36fcb72ab7f6c38", "ja": "（ジュリアを選んだのは、本当に正解だったな……。\n3人の個性の輝き、楽しみにしていよう！）", "zh": "真的选了茱莉亚就好了……期待着3个人各自的个性绽放光彩吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
